WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.860
I love the facilities here.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:20.076
I'm here like every day.

00:00:20.076 --> 00:00:22.210
This pool is just a monument
to swimming.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:25.330
It's big.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:30.880
It's nice that you can have the
50 meters in the summer.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.270
My kids take swimming
lessons here and I

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:34.520
play water polo here.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.850
The health and fitness
level of the

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:46.030
whole campus has changed.

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:48.443
I take PE classes usually in the
mornings, so it's a great

00:00:48.443 --> 00:00:49.190
way to start my day.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:51.950
I just start off really
energized and focused and

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:53.200
ready to learn.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:00.680
I was one of the first sets of
people to get a MIT pirate

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:02.750
certificate.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:08.150
And you take archery, sailing,
fencing, and pistol.

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:10.480
Ahoy, ye maties.

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.810
I'm from Minnesota, but I
actually never skated before

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:15.540
coming here, so I learned
how to skate.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.890
It's really just my way of
dealing with stress from the

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:28.650
day is coming either here
and working out or

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:30.126
doing my club sports.

00:01:53.742 --> 00:01:55.205
Pick up your rifle.

00:01:55.205 --> 00:01:57.740
Visualize your heart
beat slowing.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.920
It's all about stillness and
being able to break the

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.970
perfect shot without disturbing
the site of line,

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:07.720
the sight picture.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:10.043
And that takes an unbelievable
amount of control.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.650
MIT students tend to
be very busy and they

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.990
forget about their health.

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:29.655
By opening the Z-Center a lot
of these students stay in

00:02:29.655 --> 00:02:31.610
shape, hang out, have
a great time here.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:32.900
So it's not a one dimensional
school.

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:40.150
Bringing the Z-Center
to MIT really

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:41.910
helped us turn the corner.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:48.495
Several of our teams have gone
on to compete in the NCAA at

00:02:48.495 --> 00:02:51.110
the national level and
have been successful.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:54.225
That all comes from being able
to attract really top level

00:02:54.225 --> 00:02:55.475
student athletes.

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.810
The swim requirement can be
satisfied by this beginning

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:12.770
swim class or you can
elect to test out.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:15.250
That ability to swim this
is a good skill to have.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.070
I mean, one never knows when
they're going to be in a

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.590
situation where it's going to be
valuable where it may be a

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.840
life saving thing for them.

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:32.527
You should have left this
club when you go back.

00:03:32.527 --> 00:03:35.150
Awesome.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:35.740
Beautiful.

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:38.490
I have a launch monitor, which
gets golf club information,

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:39.620
golf ball information.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.710
I have a 3D golf
swing analyzer.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.500
It's a real pleasure to have
this to teach and I'm pretty

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.940
lucky because not many people
around who have

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.190
this good of a system.

00:03:49.879 --> 00:03:52.940
When you are doing what you
really love to do and if you

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:55.380
get really good at it then
you'll be happy.

